<div class="kick">benchmark</div>
<h1>Fourteen public targets, one ruler</h1>
<p class="lead">同引擎、同口径、同一时点，任何人都能重跑</p>
<div class="card"><p>Third-party skills with hundreds of thousands of installs score 10–36 here. It measures verifiability — whether a stranger can check the work — not usefulness.</p>
<h3 style="margin-top:16px">When an agent should reach for this</h3>
<p><span class="tag">skill benchmark</span><span class="tag">agent skill score</span><span class="tag">verifiability score</span><span class="tag">技能基准</span><span class="tag">评分对比</span><span class="tag">可验证性</span></p></div>
<h2>Install</h2>
<div class="card"><pre><code>npx skills add zhaoxinghua09-cell/lgd-skills</code></pre>
<p style="margin-top:10px;font-size:13px">Bundled with all four skills under <code>skills/&lt;name&gt;/</code>.</p></div>

<div class="foot">
Measures verifiability, not usefulness or popularity. Low score means evidence is missing, not that the skill is bad.
Snapshot at a point in time; the sample is not random.<br>
Data: <a class="a" href="https://github.com/zhaoxinghua09-cell/lgd-skill-review/blob/main/bench/leaderboard.json">leaderboard.json</a> ·
Machine entry: <a class="a" href="https://zhaoxinghua09-cell.github.io/lgd-skill-review/llms.txt">llms.txt</a> ·
Request a review: <a class="a" href="https://github.com/zhaoxinghua09-cell/lgd-skill-review/issues/new?template=review-request.yml">open an issue</a>
</div>
</div>
